<!--
  The launcher background is the app surface itself.

  It was the Android Studio wizard green, which meant the very first frame of a
  dark tactical product was a bright green tile - and on Android 12 and above
  the SplashScreen API draws this same adaptive icon, so that green was also the
  first thing shown on every cold start, before any Compose code ran.
-->
